# The compensate path decides as though every participant acked, so a saga
# whose prepare failed records and broadcasts a commit. DecideTx(t) commits
# only when every participant acked.
MODULE: AtomicCommit
ROW: DecideTx(t)
FILE: src/lattice/BPlusTree/Grains/AtomicWriteGrain.cs
DETECTORS: CompensationContinuousReaderTests.Compensation_broadcasts_TxAbort_to_every_touched_shard
SUMMARY: the compensate path decides commit although a participant's prepare failed

--- FIND
            var abortCommitted = DecideSagaCommit(everyParticipantPrepared: false);
--- REPLACE
            var abortCommitted = DecideSagaCommit(everyParticipantPrepared: true);
--- END